      "type": "text",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 445,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "CRON_CONCURRENT: false\n  → Wait for prev to finish\n\nCRON_GAP_MIN: PT10M\n  → Min 10min between runs\n\nCRON_END: 2026-12-31T23:59:59Z\n  → Stop after date\n\nCRON_COUNT: 30\n  → Stop after 30 runs",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 3
    },
